{
  "_comment": [
    "Manxome Foes for glow/glamour -- matches how Vim's stock markdown syntax",
    "renders under .vim/colors/manxome.vim.",
    "",
    "Vim group          -> manxome           -> here",
    "Normal                ctermfg=7            7",
    "Title (headings)      ctermfg=3 bold       11 (bright yellow) + bold",
    "Special (# ` etc)     ctermfg=7 bold       15",
    "Statement (list mkr)  ctermfg=6            6",
    "Comment (blockquote)  ctermfg=2 bold       10",
    "PreProc (rules)       ctermfg=7 bold       15",
    "Underlined (link txt) ctermfg=2            2  (manxome sets cterm=none: no underline)",
    "Number (URLs)         ctermfg=117          117",
    "Identifier            ctermfg=4 bold       12",
    "Constant (strings)    ctermfg=6 bold       14",
    "htmlItalic            ctermfg=174          174 (dusty rose)",
    "htmlBold              ctermfg=7 bold       15",
    "Error                 ctermfg=1 bold       9",
    "",
    "manxome leans on 'bold makes ANSI 0-7 bright'. That trick only works for the",
    "legacy SGR 30-37 codes, and glamour emits 38;5;N, so the bright slots (8-15)",
    "are named outright instead. Backgrounds are left unset so terminal",
    "transparency survives, same as manxome's ctermbg=none.",
    "",
    "Deliberate divergence: stock Vim leaves inline code unhighlighted",
    "(markdownCode has no highlight link, so it falls through to Normal) and",
    "shows the literal backticks as Special. Here it is 140 with the ticks",
    "dropped -- the color carries the meaning. manxome.vim now sets markdownCode",
    "to match.",
    "",
    "140 (#af87d7) and 174 (#d78787) are neighbours in the 256-cube's d7/af/87",
    "tier: same chroma, opposite hue. Code and emphasis stay distinguishable",
    "without either going harsh where it's used densely."
  ],

  "document": {
    "block_prefix": "\n",
    "block_suffix": "\n",
    "color": "7",
    "margin": 2
  },

  "block_quote": {
    "color": "10",
    "indent": 1,
    "indent_token": "│ "
  },

  "paragraph": {},

  "list": {
    "level_indent": 2
  },

  "heading": {
    "block_suffix": "\n",
    "color": "11",
    "bold": true
  },
  "h1": { "prefix": "# " },
  "h2": { "prefix": "## " },
  "h3": { "prefix": "### " },
  "h4": { "prefix": "#### " },
  "h5": { "prefix": "##### " },
  "h6": { "prefix": "###### " },

  "text": {},

  "strong": {
    "color": "15",
    "bold": true
  },
  "emph": {
    "color": "174",
    "italic": true
  },
  "strikethrough": {
    "crossed_out": true
  },

  "hr": {
    "color": "15",
    "format": "\n────────\n"
  },

  "item": {
    "block_prefix": "• "
  },
  "enumeration": {
    "block_prefix": ". "
  },
  "task": {
    "ticked": "[✓] ",
    "unticked": "[ ] "
  },

  "link": {
    "color": "117"
  },
  "link_text": {
    "color": "2"
  },
  "image": {
    "color": "117"
  },
  "image_text": {
    "color": "2",
    "format": "Image: {{.text}} →"
  },

  "code": {
    "color": "140"
  },

  "code_block": {
    "margin": 2,
    "chroma": {
      "text":                  { "color": "#cccccc" },
      "error":                 { "color": "#ff5f5f" },
      "comment":               { "color": "#00ff00" },
      "comment_preproc":       { "color": "#ffffff" },
      "keyword":               { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "keyword_reserved":      { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "keyword_namespace":     { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "keyword_type":          { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "operator":              { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "punctuation":           { "color": "#cccccc" },
      "name":                  { "color": "#cccccc" },
      "name_builtin":          { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "name_tag":              { "color": "#00aaaa" },
      "name_attribute":        { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "name_class":            { "color": "#5c5cff" },
      "name_constant":         { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "name_decorator":        { "color": "#5c5cff" },
      "name_exception":        { "color": "#ff5f5f" },
      "name_function":         { "color": "#5c5cff" },
      "name_other":            { "color": "#cccccc" },
      "literal":               { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "literal_number":        { "color": "#87d7ff" },
      "literal_date":          { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "literal_string":        { "color": "#00ffff" },
      "literal_string_escape": { "color": "#ffffff" },
      "generic_deleted":       { "color": "#ff5f5f" },
      "generic_emph":          { "color": "#ff00ff", "italic": true },
      "generic_heading":       { "color": "#ffff00", "bold": true },
      "generic_inserted":      { "color": "#00ff00" },
      "generic_strong":        { "color": "#ffffff", "bold": true },
      "generic_subheading":    { "color": "#ffff00" }
    }
  },

  "table": {
    "center_separator": "┼",
    "column_separator": "│",
    "row_separator": "─"
  },

  "definition_list": {},
  "definition_term": {
    "color": "6"
  },
  "definition_description": {
    "block_prefix": "\n  "
  },

  "html_block": {
    "color": "6"
  },
  "html_span": {
    "color": "6"
  }
}
